{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2JN","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"约翰二书","commonName":"约翰二书","title":"约翰二书","order":63,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"5d73beadcc6a3a41099a5e8c4ac806c964ab6a8fef828e2f7223125417f9690f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2JN/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":13},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["问候"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["作长老的写信给蒙拣选的太太",{"noteId":0},"和她的儿女，就是我诚心所爱的；不但我爱，也是一切知道真理之人所爱的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["爱你们是为真理的缘故，这真理存在我们里面，也必永远与我们同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["恩惠、怜悯、平安从父 神和他儿子耶稣基督在真理和爱心上必常与我们同在！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["真理和爱"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我见你的儿女，有照我们从父所受之命令遵行真理的，就甚欢喜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["太太啊，我现在劝你，我们大家要彼此相爱。这并不是我写一条新命令给你，乃是我们从起初所受的命令。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我们若照他的命令行，这就是爱。你们从起初所听见当行的，就是这命令。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因为世上有许多迷惑人的出来，他们不认耶稣基督是成了肉身来的；这就是那迷惑人、敌基督的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们要小心，不要失去你们",{"noteId":1},"所做的工，乃要得着满足的赏赐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["凡越过基督的教训不常守着的，就没有 神；常守这教训的，就有父又有子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["若有人到你们那里，不是传这教训，不要接他到家里，也不要问他的安；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因为问他安的，就在他的恶行上有分。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["问安"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我还有许多事要写给你们，却不愿意用纸墨写出来，但盼望到你们那里，与你们当面谈论，使你们的喜乐满足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你那蒙拣选之姊妹的儿女都问你安。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或译：教会；下同","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"有古卷：我们","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/3JN/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1JN/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}